 crates/app/src/geometry/import/step.rs        |  38 ++++-
 crates/app/src/geometry/import/step_closed.rs | 158 ++++++++++++++++++
 crates/app/tests/import_step_closed_shell.rs  |  88 ++++++++++
 .../decisions/1573-closed-shell-watertight.md |  44 +++++
